OL,3,GNEWSABrassed Off at 30: 'Community
OL,4,Aspirit has kept this village going'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith its story of pit closures and
OL,7,Fbrass bands wrapped up in pathos and
OL,8,Fnorthern humour, the 1996 film Brassed
OL,9,FOff thrust the village of Grimethorpe
OL,10,Fand the nearby town of Barnsley into
OL,11,Fthe international spotlight - and
OL,12,Fexactly 30 years after its release, its
OL,13,Flasting impact can still be felt in the
OL,14,Farea.
OL,16,FGrimethorpe Colliery shut in 1993 and
OL,17,Fjust three years later the village
OL,18,Fwhere it had stood at its heart was
OL,19,Fimmortalised in Brassed Off as Grimley.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
