OL,3,GNEWSABrassed Off at 30: 'Community
OL,4,Aspirit has kept this village going'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bafta-nominated film, starring Ewan
OL,7,FMcGregor, Sue Johnston, Pete
OL,8,FPostlethwaite and Tara Fitzgerald,
OL,9,Fportrayed the fictional village's
OL,10,Fstruggle to survive against the
OL,11,Fbackdrop of mine closures across South
OL,12,FYorkshire.
OL,14,F"Grimethorpe was the most
OL,15,Findustrialised village in Europe at
OL,16,Fthat time and when the colliery closed,
OL,17,Fit became the poorest village in
OL,18,FEurope," explains Johnny Wood.
